      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bratenahl%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Bordered by Cleveland on three sides and Lake Erie to the north, Bratenahl feels like a peninsula.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bratenahl%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A railroad that once served Glenville later became a physical barrier, separating Bratenahl from industrial Cleveland.",
